    intermediate: "The 'Club Shield': Since Clubs cannot be trumped by Diamonds, they are the safest cards to lead if you want to ensure a trick follows standard suit-ranking without interference.",
    advanced: 'Phase 1 Memory: Since you see every card entering the table/hands, remember who picked up the high Diamonds. Use your Clubs to neutralize their trump advantage during the second phase.',
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'In the first phase, if you must take a card, try to take one that completes a sequence (e.g., if you take a 10 and an 8 is on the table).',
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Save your Diamonds (Trumps) for the very end of the trick phase to secure your 'exit' from the game.",
